WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.765
Our star.

00:01.509 --> 00:08.225
The Sun is a ball of glowing gas about a hundred Earths wide, and it holds nearly all the mass of the Solar System.

00:08.764 --> 00:11.169
It turns once in about twenty-five days.

00:11.787 --> 00:16.136
The face drawn here is a map of its surface, not a picture taken today.
